     override Tailwind's stock scale never had in production at all. Since
     `@theme` custom properties cascade like any other CSS variable, that
     meant every one of the ~4,700 existing `bg-brand-500`/`text-slate-300`/
     etc. usages sitewide picked up the new values — including marketing,
     login, and admin, none of which were ever meant to change. Confirmed
     live: "buttons changed, motion graphics changed" on pages whose own
     files were byte-identical to production, because the shared color
     UNDERNEATH those unchanged files had moved.

     Fix: these slots stay at production's original values here, and the
     Nexion values move to `.nx-shell-root` below (the wrapper every
