/* ═══ CYRUS · shared kit (token modal, install modal) ════════════════════════════════�
   What the v4 studio stylesheet still provides now that the studio itself is v5 (studio.css):
   the token UI (components/cyrus-tokens, UI-CONTRACT.md: it reuses .cy-modal, .cy-btn, .cy-seg,
   .cy-tag, .cy-ib and the --cy-* variables) and the install-to-server modal
   (components/cyrus/kit/InstallModal.tsx). Both portal to <body> under .cy-tokens; inside the
   studio they read the same variables from .cyrus-root. The --cy-* palette is retuned to the v5
   look (handoff tokens: deep space #05030b, ink #f2eeff, violet #a78bfa, cyan #67e8f9). */
.cy-app, .cy-tokens {
  --cy-bg0: #05061a; --cy-bg1: #080a24; --cy-bg2: #0c0f2e;
